{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2024-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1709251200, "end_date": 1709855999, "month_true_total": 35, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:10:28 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "160021672", "author": {"steamid": "76561199069536358", "personaname": "Ean_Hunt", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/EanHunt/", "num_games_owned": 191, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 567, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 567, "last_played": 1709796250, "avatar": "106f1df5b60fe1f0f6335e17338b8895a26dfb0a"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is incredible. I played this game a while ago, getting a couple of basic achievements before not playing again due to lack of players. However, it disappeared from my library and due to this, it intrigued some friends. \r\nI got a group together to join me in playing this game, they were hesitant at best to try some super obscure game. We started the first couple of levels pretty easily, but as we got further along we had to work on our loadouts, strategy, and formations. by the end we became a well oiled machine. When we started we were boys, we came out as men.", "timestamp_created": 1709797332, "timestamp_updated": 1709797332, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.671743988990783691", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160021619", "author": {"steamid": "76561199128851391", "personaname": "Theft_Wizard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199128851391/", "num_games_owned": 183, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 511, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 454, "last_played": 1752885503, "avatar": "1bdbd96938428012a1077fb48d92d37b2b775661"}, "language": "english", "review": "so, lemme start with this. when i started this game, i was friends with these 3 men... now we are brothers bonded by war, we played this on the hardest difficulty and we fell into ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ line, operating like a well oiled machine, and all of that bonding, fun, laughing, arguing, strategizing, and accomplishment... was free. in all ernesty this 14 year old twin stick arcade shooter is one of the best team games ive played since left for dead 2. pick it up, get in a discord call with friends, and become bonded by what you will experience.", "timestamp_created": 1709797236, "timestamp_updated": 1709797236, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "160021319", "author": {"steamid": "76561199208035258", "personaname": "The Frightful Guo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199208035258/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 382, "last_played": 1752885516, "avatar": "b90fdb545c6fbafcb68ef16d2bc4ccf9d2d1398b"}, "language": "english", "review": "  Downloaded this game for the TF2 hat, but about a year later I got three friends together to get a full game. Great time.", "timestamp_created": 1709796686, "timestamp_updated": 1709796686, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.596367597579956055", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": [{"reaction